d Mirrors' (132) as shape-facet re-cuts of Wall Mirrors (not shown as tiles on the Mirrors dept page, no own tile-widget entry) and dropped 'Decorative Mirrors' (188, only reachable via the flat mega-menu, absent from the dept page's structural tile grid) as a likely curated marketing subset overlapping Wall Mirrors, not a distinct taxonomy node -- documented per Rule 0.6 rather than padding the row count. Kept Kids Mirrors (3) per Rule 0.3 (all mirrors in scope, every type). (3) Candles and Diffusers -- inspected 'Candles' (591 titles sampled): dominated by '...Soy Scented Candle' titles (fragrance), a mixed roll-up per the Home Fragrance exclusion; dropped rather than padded. Kept only 'Candle Holders' (unambiguously decorative). Dropped Oil Diffusers/Essential Oils & Fragrance/Reed Diffusers (Home Fragrance, explicit exclusion). (4) Wall Art -- kept the 'Art by Type' tree (Canvas Prints, Wall Art Prints, Framed Prints, Paintings, Photography Art, Drawing & Illustration, Sets & Gallery Walls, 3D & Embossed Art, Acrylic Art, Metal Wall Art) as canonical; dropped 'Art by Subject' and 'Art by Size' as facet re-cuts of the same underlying wall-art inventory sliced by a different dimension (would double/triple count). Kept Wall Stickers & Decals (inspected titles: genuine decorative wall decals, e.g. 'Watercolor Flock Of Birds Wall Decal') and Wall Accents & Hangings. Kept Kids Wall Decor (91, all decals) but dropped the broader 'Kids Decor' roll-up (133, mixed wall decals + cushions/textiles) to avoid padding. (5) Kitchen & Dining -- kept Dinnerware's Dinner Sets/Plates & Bowls/Servingware and Drinkware & Barware's Glasses/Jugs & Decanters/Mugs & Teacups plus standalone Salt & Pepper Grinders & Shakers. Excluded Cutlery Sets, Tablecloths & Placemats (textile), Barware & Bar Accessories (bar tools, explicit exclusion), Water Bottles and Wine Racks (functional/storage, not decor), all Cookware/Bakeware/appliances (explicit exclusion), and 'Coffee & Tea' (185 titles sampled: mix of decorative mugs/teapots plus coffee machines and milk frothers -- appliances -- a mixed roll-up, dropped rather than padded). (6) Outdoor -- 'Outdoor Decor' (217, titles sampled: outdoor lounge chairs, modular sofas, side tables, fireplace tool sets, tool trolley, bike rack) is mislabeled/mostly outdoor FURNITURE, not decor -- excluded as a mixed roll-up. Kept the genuinely decorative Garden Ornaments, Plant Pots & Stands (planters), and Water Features. Excluded 'Outdoor Tableware' (185, titles sampled: melamine picnic sets, cooler box, picnic rugs -- functional picnic/camping gear plus textile picnic rugs, not decorative tableware). Excluded Doormats/Outdoor Cushions/Outdoor Rugs (textiles), BBQs/heaters/pools (appliance/fixture), umbrellas/gazebos/bean bags (furniture). (7) Bathroom Accessories -- kept Soap Dispensers/Trays & Dishes and Toothbrush Holders (inspected titles: genuinely decorative small accessories). Excluded Toilet Roll Holders (mounted hardware/fixture, not a decorative accessory), Toilet Brushes, Bath & Shower Caddies, and 'Bathroom Accessories & Organisation' (titles sampled: bathroom cabinets, bath caddies, over-door shower caddies -- storage/furniture, excluded). (8) Excluded entirely, not traversed further: Rugs (textile/floor covering), Bedding/Cushions/Towels/Bathrobes (Bed & Bath dept, textiles), Curtains & Blinds/Soft Furnishings (window treatment textile), Wallpaper & Decorating and Tiles (explicit wallpaper exclusion + flooring/wall surface, not decor), Renovation dept's Bathroom/Kitchen Fixtures, Heating & Cooling, Hardware (door/cabinet hardware, doorstops, brackets -- functional hardware, not decorative metal accents), Artificial Plants & Flowers (explicit exclusion), Kitchenware's Cookware/Bakeware/appliances/utensils/bins, all Furniture, Office, Baby & Kids furniture/bedding/toys, Pets, Fitness & Leisure, Bags & Luggage -- none contain decor-relevant product types per the brief's scope. No duplicate-company flag applies 